      "side": 0,
      "message": "Tests I\u0027ve done:\n\n* Start discovery and let it naturally expire.\n* Start discovery, cancel discovery, start discovery and let it expire.\n* Start discovery, cancel discovery, wait for a while for timer to expire.\n\nAll work as expected wrt/ the state machine. After either the cancel_discovery is run OR the timer expires, `p_inq-\u003einq_active` is set to `BTM_INQUIRY_INACTIVE` and we hit the `else` block below (LOG_ERROR(\"Received inquiry complete when no inquiry was active\")). If the controller runs `inquiry complete` correctly, we never hit that error message.",
